1
00:00:03,203 --> 00:00:06,077
A part adds one capability to a content type.

2
00:00:06,077 --> 00:00:10,416
To let each article choose its own widgets for named zones, the Article

3
00:00:10,416 --> 00:00:12,558
type needs the WidgetsList part.

4
00:00:12,558 --> 00:00:17,123
The About page is an Article, so let's edit that type and choose Add Parts.

5
00:00:17,599 --> 00:00:23,477
WidgetsList is described as a way to add widgets to layout zones for your content item.

6
00:00:23,477 --> 00:00:27,459
Add & Configure attaches the part and opens its settings.

7
00:00:28,103 --> 00:00:32,920
Available widgets zones takes a comma separated list of zone names.

8
00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:38,133
Let's enter Content and Footer, two zones of this theme, and choose Save.

9
00:00:38,628 --> 00:00:45,228
The Parts list of Article includes WidgetsList, and every article offers those two zones for widgets.

